text: ['Create X 4/4 white Angel creature tokens with flying.\\nCycling {2}{W} ({2}{W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Decree of Justice, you may pay {X}. If you do, create X 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.', 'Destroy target permanent.', 'Sacrifice a Beast: You gain 4 life.', 'Until end of turn, you may play lands and cast spells from your graveyard.\\nIf a card would be put into your graveyard from anywhere this turn, exile that card instead.', 'You may reveal an instant card you own from outside the game and put it into your hand. Exile Cunning Wish.']
flavor: ['"All we know about the Krosan Forest we have learned from those few who made it out alive."\\n—Elvish refugee', 'Some convictions are so strong that the world must break to accommodate them.', 'The foolish wish for that which they desire. The cunning wish for that which they require.']
